# FS-169 (14 Oct 2026): internal files are NOT tracked here - this repo is public and
# GitHub Pages (.nojekyll) serves every tracked file on fieldnotesecurity.com. They stay
# on disk for local tools (Claude Code reads .claude/ from disk; design tools read the
# docs). Maintained copies of the four docs: the private scanner repo, docs/website/.
.claude/
.impeccable/
WORKFLOW.md
PRODUCT.md
DESIGN.md
TESTING.md

# Secrets: never commit. GitHub Pages serves every tracked file on
# fieldnotesecurity.com, so a stray secret file here goes live.
# .githooks/pre-commit blocks these names too, even with `git add -f`.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.har
credentials*.json
service-account*.json
